<title>USA: Met-Coil Systems CFO leaves for new job.</title>
<headline>Met-Coil Systems CFO leaves for new job.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Met-Coil Systems Corp said chief financial officer Joseph Ceryanec has accepted a job at another company.</p>
<p>Randall Stodola, comptroller, will assume Ceryanec's duties, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
